      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by substituting for the words \"21, 21B, 21c, 21D, 21E or 21F\" the words \"21, 21B, 21BA, 21C, 21D, 21DA, 21E, 21F, 21G, 21H, 21I, 21 J, 21K, 21L or 21M\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_17__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by substituting for the words \"21, 21B, 21c, 21D, 21E or 21F\" the words \"21, 21B, 21BA, 21C, 21D, 21DA, 21E, 21F, 21G, 21H, 21I, 21J, 21K, 21L or 21M\". Amendment of section 24"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 24(1) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the word \"twelve\" the word \"six\". Amendment of section 25"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_19__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_19__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_19__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 25 of the principal Act is amended —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_19__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by substituting for the words \"21(1), 21B(2), 21C(2), 21D(2), 21E(2) or 21F(2)\" the words \"21(1), 21B(2), 21BA(2), 21C(2), 21D(2), 21DA(2), 21E(2), 21F(2), 21G(2), 21H(2), 21i(2), 21j(2), (3), (4), (5), 21K(2), or 21M(2)\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_19__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (2)(b), by substituting for the words \"21(1), 21B(2), 21C(2), 21D(2), 21E(2) or 21F(2)\" the words \"21(1), 21B(2), 21BA(2), 21C(2), 21D(2), 21DA(2), 21E(2), 21F(2), 21G(2), 21H(2), 211(2), 21J(2), (3), (4), (5), 21K(2), 21L(2) or 21M(2)\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_19__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (4) the following subsection: \"(4) Where, by reason of an insufficiency or absence of statutory income from the pioneer business or pioneer businesses for a year of assessment, effect cannot be given or cannot be given in full to any deduction falling to be made for that year pursuant to subsection (2), that deduction which has not been so made (or so much thereof as has not been so made) for that year shall be made in computing the total income of the company in accordance with subsections 43(2) and 44(2) of the principal Act for the year of assessment in the basis period in which the day of commencement of the post pioneer business falls or any subsequent year of assessment: Provided that the tax relief period ends on — (a) its expiry date; or (b) the date of surrendering of pioneer status or pioneer certificate under section 9A, and such date shall not be earlier than 1 October 2005.\". Amendment of section 26"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Promotion of Investments (Amendment) Act 2007."
      }
    },
