    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_2__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_2__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_2__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_2__para_f",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_2__para_g"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Promotion of Investments Act 1986 [Act 327], which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended in subsection 2(1) —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 26 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (3) the following subsection: \"(3) Where a company has been granted pioneer status, in respect of a promoted activity or promoted product, it may be eligible to apply for approval for the purpose of an investment tax allowance under subsection (1) upon giving a notice in writing to the Minister to surrender the grant of pioneer status in relation to that promoted activity or promoted product: Provided that this subsection shall only apply where the Minister is satisfied with the reasons for the surrender of the pioneer status in respect of that promoted activity or promoted product.\". Amendment of section 26B"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_21__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_21__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 26B of the principal Act is amended —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_21__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (3) the followin; subsection: \"(3) Where a company has been granted pioneer status, in respect of a promoted activity or promoted product, it may be eligible to apply for approval for the purpose of an investment tax allowance under subsection (1) upon giving a notice in writing to the Minister to surrender the grant of pioneer status in relation to that promoted activity or promoted product: Provided that this subsection shall only apply where the Minister is satisfied with the reasons for the surrender of the pioneer status in respect of that promoted activity or promoted product.\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_21__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting subsection (4). Amendment of section 26c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 26c of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(2) Where a company has been granted pioneer status, in respect of an activity relating to research and development, it may be eligible to apply for approval for the purpose of an investment tax allowance under subsection (1) upon giving a notice in writing to the Minister to surrender the grant of pioneer status in relation to that activity: Provided that this subsection shall only apply where the Minister is satisfied with the reasons for the surrender of the pioneer status in respect of that activity.\". Amendment of section 26F"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_23",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 26F of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (3) the following subsection: \"(3) Where a company has been granted pioneer status, in respect of a promoted activity or promoted product, it may be eligible to apply for approval for the purpose of an investment tax allowance under subsection (1) upon giving a notice in writing to the Minister to surrender the grant of pioneer status in relation to that promoted activity or promoted product: Provided that this subsection shall only apply where the Minister is satisfied with the reasons for the surrender of the pioneer status in respect of that promoted activity or promoted product.\". Amendment of section 26G"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_24__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_24__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_24__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 26G of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_24__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_24",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the shoulder note, by inserting after the word \"company\" the words \"and private higher educational institutions\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_24__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_24",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(2) Any existing or new private higher educational institution that provides or intends to provide qualifying science courses in Malaysia as approved by the Minister of Finance, may make an application in writing to the Minister for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance, provided that such application is received on or after 1 October 2005.\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_24__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_24",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(3) An application made under subsection (1) or (2) shall be in accordance with such regulations as may be made under this Act.\". New sections 26H, 26I, 26J, 26K, 26L, 26M, 26N and 26o"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_25__subsec_3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 26G the following sections: \"Application for approval for investment tax allowance for strategic knowledge-intensive activity 26H. ( 1 ) Any existing or new company participating or intending to participate in a strategic knowledge-intensive activity in Malaysia may make an application in writing to the Minister for approval for the purpose of an investment tax allowance, provided that such application is received on or after 21 September 2002. (2) Where a company has been granted pioneer status in respect of a strategic knowledge-intensive activity, it may be eligible to apply for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance under subsection (1) upon giving notice in writing to the Minister to surrender the pioneer status in relation to that activity: Provided that this subsection shall only apply where the Minister is satisfied with the reasons for the surrender of the pioneer status in respect of that activity."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_25__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_25",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An application made under subsection (1) shall be in accordance with such regulations as may be made under this Act. Application for approval for investment tax allowance in respect of an activity or product in selected industries as prescribed under section 4D"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 27 of the principal Act is amended —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26I",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26I",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26I__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26I__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26I__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "( 1 ) Any company participating or intending to participate in Malaysia in a promoted activity or in the production of a promoted product in selected industries as prescribed under section 4D, may make an application in writing to the Minister for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance, provided that such application is received on or after the date as prescribed in the statutory order published in the Gazette."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26I__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A pioneer company or a company which has been granted pioneer status or an approval under section 27i, shall only be eligible to apply for investment tax allowance under subsection ( 1) in respect of a promoted activity or promoted product other than the promoted activity or promoted product for which a pioneer certificate has been issued, or pioneer status or investment tax allowance has been granted."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26I__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a company has been granted pioneer status in respect of promoted activity or in the production of a promoted product in selected industries as prescribed under section 4D, it may be eligible to apply for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance under subsection (1) upon giving notice in writing to the Minister to surrender the pioneer status in relation to that promoted activity or in the production of that promoted product: Provided that this subsection shall only apply where the Minister is satisfied with the reasons for the surrender of the pioneer status in respect of that promoted activity or in the production of that promoted product."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26I__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An application made under subsection (1) shall be in accordance with such regulations as may be made under this Act. Application for approval for investment tax allowance in respect of an activity or product in automotive component modules industry as prescribed under section 4E"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26J",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26J",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26J__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26J__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26J__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "( 1) Any company participating or intending to participate in Malaysia in a promoted activity or in the production of a promoted product in the automotive component modules industry as prescribed under section 4E, may make an application in writing to the Minister for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance, provided that such application is received on or after the date as prescribed in the statutory order published in the Gazette."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26J__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26J",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A pioneer company or a company which has been granted pioneer status or an approval under section 27J, shall only be eligible to apply for investment tax allowance under subsection (1) in respect of a promoted activity or promoted product other than the promoted activity or promoted product for which a pioneer certificate has been issued, or pioneer status or investment tax allowance has been granted."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26J__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26J",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a company has been granted pioneer status in respect of promoted activity or in the production of a promoted product under section 4E, it may be eligible to apply for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance under subsection (1) upon giving notice in writing to the Minister to surrender the pioneer status in relation to that promoted activity or in the production of that promoted product: Provided that this subsection shall only apply where the Minister is satisfied with the reasons for the surrender of the pioneer status in respect of that promoted activity or in the production of that promoted product."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26J__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26J",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An application made under subsection (1) shall be in accordance with such regulations as may be made under this Act. Application for approval for investment tax allowance in respect of reinvestment in an activity or product as prescribed under section 4F"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26K",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_5"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any company undertaking or intending to undertake reinvestment in an activity or in the production of product in Malaysia as prescribed under section 4F, may make an application in writing to the Minister for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance: Provided that—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "such application is received on or after the date as prescribed in the statutory order published in the Gazette; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the tax relief period for that company under section 14, 14A or 14c or the period as prescribed under section 29, 29A, 29AA, 29B, 29C, 29G, 29J, 29K, 29M or 29N has ended."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A pioneer company or a company which has been granted pioneer status or an approval under section 27K, shall only be eligible to apply for investment tax allowance under subsection (1) in respect of a promoted activity or promoted product other than the promoted activity or promoted product for which a pioneer certificate has been issued or pioneer status or investment tax allowance has been granted."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any contract research and development company, research and development company or a company carrying out in-house research, undertaking or intending to undertake reinvestment in Malaysia, in relation to a research and development activity or services thereof, may make an application in writing to the Minister for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance for the same promoted activity or services: Provided that—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "such application is received on or after 21 May 2003; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the tax relief period for that company under section 14, 14A or 14c or the period as prescribed under section 29D, 29E or 29F has ended."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a company has been granted pioneer status, in respect of promoted activity or in the production of a promoted product under section 4F, it may be eligible to apply for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance under subsection (1) upon giving notice in writing to the Minister to surrender the pioneer status in relation to that promoted activity or in the production of that promoted product: Provided that this subsection shall only apply where the Minister is satisfied with the reasons for the surrender of the pioneer status in respect of that promoted activity or in the production of that promoted product."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26K",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An application made under subsections (1) and (2) shall be in accordance with such regulations as may be made under this Act. Application for approval for investment tax allowance to a company relocating an existing promoted activity or promoted product relating to a manufacturing activity in Malaysia from outside a promoted area in Malaysia to a promoted area under section 4c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26L",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any company relocating an existing promoted activity or existing promoted product relating to a manufacturing activity in Malaysia from outside a promoted area in Malaysia to a promoted area under section 4c, may make an application in writing to the Minister for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance: Provided that —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "such application is received on or after 11 September 2004; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the tax relief period for that company under section 14, 14A or 14c, or the period as prescribed under section 29, 29A, 29AA, 29B, 29G, 29J, 29K, 29L or 29N has ended or surrendered for cancellation."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a company has been granted pioneer status, in respect of promoted activity or in the production of a promoted product in a promoted area under section 4c, it may be eligible to apply for investment tax allowance under subsection (1) upon giving notice in writing to the Minister to surrender the pioneer status in relation to that promoted activity or in the production of that promoted product: Provided that this subsection shall only apply where the Minister is satisfied with the reasons for the surrender of the pioneer status in respect of that promoted activity or in the production of that promoted product."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26L",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An application made under subsection (1) shall be in accordance with such regulations as may be made under this Act. Application for approval for investment tax allowance to a company undertaking the production of halal food product"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26M",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26M",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26M__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26M__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26M__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26M__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26M",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any company participating or intending to participate in Malaysia in the production of halal food product may make an application in writing to the Minister for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance, provided that such application is received on or after 11 September 2004."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26M__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26M",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A pioneer company or a company which has been granted pioneer status or an approval under section 27M, shall only be eligible to apply for investment tax allowance under subsection (1) in respect of a promoted activity or promoted product other than the promoted activity or promoted product for which a pioneer certificate has been issued, or pioneer status or investment tax allowance has been granted."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26M__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26M",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An application made under subsection (1) shall be in accordance with such regulations as may be made under this Act. Application for approval for investment tax allowance to a company conserving energy for own consumption"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26N",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26N",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "(1) Any company incurring or intending to incur capital expenditure for conserving energy for own consumption may make an application in writing to the Minister for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance, provided that such application is received on or after 1 October 2005. (2) An application made under subsection (1) shall be in accordance with such regulations as may be made under this Act. Application for approval for investment tax allowance to a company undertaking information and communication technology or multimedia activity 26o. ( 1 ) Any company participating or intending to participate in Malaysia in information and communication technology or multimedia activities may make an application in writing to the Minister for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance, provided that such application is received on or after 1 October 2005. (2) Where a company has been granted pioneer status, in respect of promoted activity in relation to information and communication technology or multimedia activities, it may be eligible to apply for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance under subsection (1) upon giving notice in writing to the Minister to surrender the pioneer status in relation to that promoted activity: Provided that this subsection shall only apply where the Minister is satisfied with the reasons for the surrender of the pioneer status in respect of that promoted activity. (3) An application made under subsection (1) shall be in accordance with such regulations as may be made under this Act.\". Amendment of section 27"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection ( 1 ) the following subsection: \"(1A) The Minister may grant approval in respect of an application for an investment tax allowance made under subsection 26(1) to a small company, subject to such terms and conditions as he deems fit: Provided that— (a) where the Minister is satisfied that the company was engaged in an activity, or had otherwise incurred capital expenditure in relation thereto, from a date prior to the date from such activity was deemed as a promoted activity under section 4, the approval may be granted retrospectively from a date not earlier than 21 May 2003; and (b) no approval shall be granted retrospectively under subsection (1A) or under the foregoing proviso from a date which is earlier than three years from the date the application under subsection 26(1) is received by the Minister.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by substituting for the words \"subsection (1)\" the words \"subsections (1) and (1A)\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (3), by inserting after the words \"subsections (1)\" the words \", (1A)\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (4) the following subsection: \"(4) A company granted approval under this subsection may, at any time during the period specified in paragraph 29(2)(b) or (c), surrender the approval by giving notice in writing to the Minister and where the Minister is satisfied with the reasons for the surrender of such approval or that the company has complied with the terms and conditions imposed under subsection ( 1 ) , (1A) or (2) or with any other provisions of this Act, the surrender shall have effect from a date specified by the Minister in the notice approving such surrender and such date shall not be earlier than the date the notice is received by the Minister.\". Amendment of section 27G"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_27__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_27__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_27__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 27G of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_27__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the shoulder note, by inserting after the word \"26G(1)\" the words \"or (2)\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_27__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsections (2) and (3) the following subsections: \"(2) The Minister may grant approval in respect of an application for an investment tax allowance made under subsection 26G(2) subject to such terms and conditions as he deems fit: Provided that— (a) where the Minister is satisfied that the institution was engaged in an activity or had otherwise incurred capital expenditure in relation thereto, from a date prior to the date from which the activity was deemed as a promoted activity under section 4B, the approval may be granted retrospectively from a date not earlier than 1 October 2005; and (b) no approval shall be granted retrospectively under subsection (2) or under the foregoing proviso from a date which is earlier than three years from the date the application under subsection 26G(2) is received by the Minister. (3) The Minister may vary the terms and conditions imposed under subsection (1) or (2).\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_27__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: \"(4) In exercising his powers under subsections (1), (2) and (3), the Minister shall act with the concurrence in writing of the Minister of Finance.\". New sections 27H, 27I, 27J, 27K, 27L, 27M, 27N and 27o"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@/~cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "28",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/15/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 27G the following sections: \"Grant of approval of application for investment tax allowance made under subsection 26H(1) 27H. (1) The Minister may grant approval in respect of an application for an investment tax allowance made under subsection 26H(1) subject to such terms and conditions as he deems fit: Provided that— (a) where the Minister is satisfied that the company was engaged in an activity, or had otherwise incurred capital expenditure in relation thereto, from a date prior to the date from such activity was deemed as a promoted activity under section 4B, the approval may be granted retrospectively from a date not earlier than 21 September 2002; and (b) no approval shall be granted retrospectively under subsection (1) or under the foregoing proviso from a date which is earlier than three years from the date the application under subsection 26H(1) is received by the Minister. (2) The Minister may vary the terms and conditions imposed under subsection (1). (3) In exercising his powers under subsections (1) and (2), the Minister shall act with the concurrence in writing of the Minister of Finance. Grant of approval of application for investment tax allowance made under subsection 26i(l) 27I. (1) The Minister may grant approval in respect of an application for an investment tax allowance made under subsection 26I(l) subject to such terms and conditions as he deems fit: Provided that— (a) where the Minister is satisfied that the company was engaged in an activity, or had otherwise incurred capital expenditure in relation thereto, from a date prior to the date from which the activity or product was deemed as a promoted activity or promoted product under section 4D, the approval may be granted retrospectively from a date not earlier than the date as prescribed by the Minister under section 4D; and (b) no approval shall be granted retrospectively under subsection (1) or under the foregoing proviso from a date which is earlier than three years from the date the application under subsection 26i(l) is received by the Minister. (2) The Minister may vary the terms and conditions imposed under subsection (1). (3) In exercising his powers under subsections (1) and (2), the Minister shall act with the concurrence in writing of the Minister of Finance. Grant of approval of application for investment tax allowance made under subsection 26J(l) 27j. (1) The Minister may grant approval in respect of an application for an investment tax allowance made under subsection 26J(1) subject to such terms and conditions as he deems fit: Provided that— (a) where the Minister is satisfied that the company was engaged in an activity, or had otherwise incurred capital expenditure in relation thereto, from a date prior to the date from which the activity or product was deemed as a promoted activity or promoted product under section 4E, the approval may be granted retrospectively from a date not earlier than the date as prescribed by the Minister under section 4E; and (b) no approval shall be granted retrospectively under subsection (1) or under the foregoing proviso from a date which is earlier than three years from the date the application under subsection 26J(1) is received by the Minister. (2) The Minister may vary the terms and conditions imposed under subsection (1). (3) In exercising his powers under subsections ( 1) and (2), the Minister shall act with the concurrence in writing of the Minister of Finance. Grant of approval of application for investment tax allowance made under subsection 26K(1) 27K. (1) The Minister may grant approval in respect of an application for an investment tax allowance made under subsection 26K(1) subject to such terms and conditions as he deems fit: Provided that where the Minister is satisfied that the company was engaged in an activity or had otherwise incurred capital expenditure in relation thereto, from a date prior to the date from which the activity or product was deemed as a promoted activity or promoted product under section 4F, the approval may be granted on the first day capital expenditure is incurred and that date shall not be earlier than the date the application is received by the Minister. (2) In relation to hotel business and tourist project, approval shall be granted retrospectively under subsection (1) from a date not earlier than the date from which the company has incurred capital expenditure in relation thereto, but not earlier than three years from the date the application under subsection 26K(1) is received by the Minister. (3) The Minister may vary the terms and conditions imposed under subsections (1) and (2). (4) In exercising his powers under subsections (1), (2) and (3), the Minister shall act with the concurrence in writing of the Minister of Finance. Grant of approval of application for investment tax allowance made under subsection 26L(1) 27L. (1) The Minister may grant approval in respect of an application for an investment tax allowance made under subsection 26L(1) subject to such terms and conditions as he deems fit: Provided that— (a) where the Minister is satisfied that the company was engaged in an activity or had otherwise incurred capital expenditure in relation thereto, from a date prior to the date from which the activity or product was deemed as a promoted activity or promoted product in a promoted area under section 4c, the approval may be granted retrospectively from a date not earlier than 11 September 2004; and (b) no approval shall be granted retrospectively under subsection (1) or under the foregoing proviso from a date which is earlier than three years from the date the application under subsection 26L(1) is received by the Minister. (2) The Minister may vary the terms and conditions imposed under subsection (1). (3) In exercising his powers under subsections (1) and (2), the Minister shall act with the concurrence in writing of the Minister of Finance. Grant of approval of application for investment tax allowance made under subsection 26M(1) 27M. (1) The Minister may grant approval in respect of an application for an investment tax allowance made under subsection 26M(1) to a company undertaking the production of halal food product subject to such terms and conditions as he deems fit: Provided that— (a) where the Minister is satisfied that the company was engaged in an activity, or had otherwise incurred capital expenditure in relation thereto, the approval may be granted retrospectively from a date not earlier than 11 September 2004; and (b) no approval shall be granted retrospectively under subsection (1) or under the foregoing proviso from a date which is earlier than three years from the date the application under subsection 26M(1) is received by the Minister. (2) The Minister may vary the terms and conditions imposed under subsection (1). (3) In exercising his powers under subsections (1) and (2), the Minister shall act with the concurrence in writing of the Minister of Finance. Grant of approval of application for investment tax allowance made under subsection 26N(1) 27N. (1) The Minister may grant approval in respect of an application for an investment tax allowance made under subsection 26N(1) subject to such terms and conditions as he deems fit: Provided that— (a) where the Minister is satisfied that the company was engaged in an activity, or had otherwise incurred capital expenditure in relation thereto, the approval may be granted retrospectively from a date not earlier than 1 October 2005; and (b) no approval shall be granted retrospectively under subsection (1) or under the foregoing proviso from a date which is earlier than three years from the date the application under subsection 26N(1) is received by the Minister. (2) The Minister may vary the terms and conditions imposed under subsection (1). (3) In exercising his powers under subsections (1) and (2), the Minister shall act with the concurrence in writing of the Minister of Finance. Grant of approval of application for investment tax allowance made under subsection 26o(l) 27o. (1) The Minister may grant approval in respect of an application for an investment tax allowance made under subsection 26o(l) subject to such terms and conditions as he deems fit: Provided that — (a) where the Minister is satisfied that the company was engaged in an activity, or had otherwise incurred capital expenditure in relation thereto, the approval may be granted retrospectively from a date not earlier than 1 October 2005; and (b) no approval shall be granted retrospectively under subsection (1) or under the foregoing proviso from a date which is earlier than three years from the date the application under subsection 26o(l) is received by the Minister. (2) The Minister may vary the terms and conditions imposed under subsection (1). (3) In exercising his powers under subsections (1) and (2), the Minister shall act with the concurrence in writing of the Minister of Finance.\". Amendment of section 28"
      }
    },
