        "@value": "by substituting for the words \"subsection 5(lc), sections 26c, 26D, 26E and 26G\" the words \"subsections 5(lc), 5(1DA), sections 26c, 26D, 26E, 26G and 26H\". New sections 4D, 4E and 4F"
